index 0000000..db26b55
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7228.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fixed a crash when a regular expression option (e.g. ``function-rgx``) contained
+an invalid pattern such as ``\p{Han}``. Pylint now reports a proper configuration
+error instead of an unhandled traceback.
+
+Closes #7228
